        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini Na Oboriri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini nigo bweagacherete enyomba. Nigo bwebaacherete chisiiro isano na ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyenyire ching’iti chiaye; bwochoganirie edivai yaye, bwariganirie emesa yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwatomire abasomba baye abaiseke gochia aase aimokererete igoro mono yomochie korangeria abanto, bogoteeba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oyo otamanyeti amaange, tiga ache aa!” Na ase oyore omoriri bwateeba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inchuo orie endagera y’ane, na onywe edivai nochoganirie!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga oboriri bwao, erinde obe moyo! Obwatie enchera y’okonyora okomanya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto ogokuurera omonyacheche, nigo akwenyorera obororo; na oyogotogonyera omonto omokori amabe nigo akwenyorera ogochaaywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa gokuurera omonto omochaayi; oyio nigo arakogeche. Kuurera omonto omong’aini, oyio nigo aragwanche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orokereria omonto omong’aini, oyio nigo arageenderere koba omong’aini goetania. Orokereria omonto omooronge, oyio namente koba ne chiseemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okomoiroka Omonene, oyio n’oro omochakano bw’obong’aini, na okomomanya Oyore Omochenu nabwo obomanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ogokonywa kw’ane amatuko ao nabe amaange, na emiaka y’obogima bwao nementwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korabe nobong’aini, borobwo ’mbooboseemia; korende korabe omochaayi, obochaayi obwo ’mbokoiranere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu omoriri nigo are omonyariogi. Ere nigo are bosa, na tamanyeti ring’ana rinde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo agoikaransera ekerogo ase egesieri ki’enyomba yaye, agwo aase aimokererete igoro ase omochie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba okorangeria abaeti bare ase orogendo rwabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oteeba, “Onde bwensi otamanyeti amaange, tiga ache aa!” Na ase oyore omoriri oteeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amaache aibire nigo are amansu, na omogati okorierwa aase abobisi nigo ogwansa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende oyio ogosoa aroro tamanyeti ng’a amakweri nareo, naende ng’a abageni b’omokuungu oyio nigo bare agwo aase abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
